cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Resilio: AI Cybersecurity Agent for SMBs"
abstract: >-
  An AI-powered cybersecurity advisor for small and mid-sized businesses.
  Combines retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) over NIST CSF 2.0,
  NIST SP 800-53, and CIS Controls v8 with a tool-using ReAct agent
  for risk math, IT budget estimation, and ROSI/ALE/SLE analysis.
  Exposes tools over a Model Context Protocol (MCP) HTTP server.
